@startuml
!include style.puml

title Archive and restore workflow

start
:Display an active result view;
:Run **archive INDEX**;
:Create an archived copy of the selected student\nwhile preserving every other field;
:Replace and save the student;
:Student disappears from active results;
:Run **list archived**;
:Display archived students;

if (Choose an action for an archived student) then ([unarchive])
    :Run **unarchive INDEX**;
    :Create an active copy while preserving\nevery other field;
    :Replace and save the student;
    :Run **list**;
    :Display the restored student\nin active results;
else ([delete])
    :Run **delete INDEX**;
    :Permanently remove and save the student;
endif

stop

@enduml
